            "review_title": "Review at Yen Huong Giang - Bun Bo Hue",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n1\nSimply delicious selection of Vietnamese Soups in District 3\nJan 2019 • Friends\nI arrived here on the back of one my local friend's bikes.\nThe restaurant was full of locals, which is always good sign, and after a short wait we were seated. There are over 32 different types of soups / Pho to select from. The two we chose were simply delicious. It is stock that makes it so special. I asked permission to take a picture of bones been picked to make stock and have included this. A totally satisfying and authentic local meal, total cost including drinks less than $4 per person! This place is well worth visiting.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 10, 2019",
