            "review_title": "Review at Yen Huong Giang - Bun Bo Hue",
            "review_text": "Myan\nLos Angeles, California28 contributions\n0\nBun Bo Hue!\nDec 2018 • Family\nI have been dying to get some Bun Bo Hue in Saigon and was recommended to come here by my family. We took a Grab to get here. The bottom floor was packed when we arrived so we opted for upstairs which was way cooler with AC.\n\nWe ordered the Dac Biet with everything and also just the plain beef slices. The broth was savory and delicious. Combination of meats were delightful. Yummy chili oil to go with. Couldn’t stop sipping on the broth after. Fresh veggies were so yummy with the soup. We also ordered fresh coconut juice and fresh pressed pineapple juice. It’s a popular place. Young crowds. Will be back!\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
